  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heal the land and strengthen the guarani people</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CGY institutionally strengthened through improving participation and dialogue between Tenond&#xe9;, State and Regional Coordinators and other Guarani leaders in meetings and assemblies; intensified political and legal impact of the Guarani; Guarani women within CGY strengthened through increased participation in activities and governance forums of the association; stepped-up support to self-organized groups of Guarani women; promotion of internal dialogues on combating gender and generational violence in guarani villages. Also, management and protection of Guarani lands strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
